  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia Bay Region Joint Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia has been impacted by the worst drought in the last 40 years. The humanitarian situation in Somalia, especially the Bay region, has deteriorated  in recent months. The coping capacity of the communities is exhausted due to the combined impact of 4 consecutive seasons of poor rainfall, sharp increases in food prices, and conflict. WC/WRRS will implement a multisector intervention that provides WASH and FSL support to ensure access to food and water for the most affected HHs in 10 IDP sites in Baidoa district.</narrative>
  </description>
